  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: race condition in the ssl module: cert_store_stats()\n     and get_ca_certs() read the certificate store of an SSLContext without\n     holding its lock (CVE-2024-0397)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2024-0397.patch: take a locked deep copy of the\n       store's objects (X509_STORE_get1_objects() shim built on\n       X509_STORE_lock()) in cert_store_stats() and get_ca_certs() in\n       Modules/_ssl.c, and free it after use\n     - CVE-2024-0397",
